((content))
The help area is split up into a few different pages:

====First Time Users====

The [help/get_started]{Getting Started Guide} shows you how to write your first page, and how to use bug markup/formatting. 

The [help/bug_syntax]{Bug Markup Quick-Reference} page shows you how to write pages using bug.

====Getting the Most out of your Instance====

The [help/user_guide]{User Guide} goes into detail with getting the most out of your kiki instance by modifying the settings, selecting a markup language, using RSS feeds, and generating dynamic pages.

The [help/themes]{Theme and Templating Guide} explains how themes work, and how you can build your own.

====Programming====

The [help/programming]{Programming Guide} is for the coder who wants to make modifications to how kiki works under the hood, including sketches of the program flow and tips on where to make your modifications.